window.products.push({"id":281129,"name":"Strobel Organic Tuson Complete Waterbed 4 Board Frame Oak Finish King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817c9ttKytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete hard-side wood frame waterbed. Comes with frame, headboard, Strobel Organic ‘Hydro-Support 1400’ Feathertop 3-7-3 lumbar fiber waveless water mattress (not a cheap imported free flow water-mattress), solid state heater with controller, safety liner, wood deck, fill and drain kit with conditioner, and hot lacquer finished solid pine pedestal. No Headboard option allows you to use your own headboard to blend with existing furniture. You can also use a full drape bedspread to cover wood frame if you choose. Bed is made from solid wood northwestern white pine. This furniture grade 2 x 10” solid wood furniture produces a beautiful finish. All exposed edges are machine rounded. We sand, stain, seal, and use two coats of hot liquor to bring out the beauty of the wood. Strobel Hydro Support Waterbeds feature our Feathertop deep moulded surface. While most waterbeds do not have a moulded surface ours is deeper moulded than any other on the market, this creates more surface area of vinyl and gives better true water support. The stretched tight surface of other waterbeds and softsides can give a hammock or trampoline effect which supports you and not the true conforming water. The Feathertop gives the lowest skin pressures and no pressure points for greatest comfort and best sleep. Also check out add on items like cushioned rail caps to give a more comfortable sitting edge, and drawer pedestals in different styles and heights that give great extra storage. These and other furniture are additional items that are not included with the bed even though they might show in the photo. Hand Crafted in USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817c9ttKytL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Strobel Organic","source_asin":"B0772RZ74N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0772RZ74N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0772RZ74N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":281130,"name":"Dream Catchers Wall Decor Boho Dream Catcher with Lights Boho Bedroom Decor Blue Dream Catcher for Girls Dreamcatcher Boho Decor 27\" Length","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oojphniXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎【Gorgeous Boho Dream Catcher】Dreaming of some bright boho wall hanging to liven up your space? This beautiful multi-tier dream catcher wall decor features five rings, comforting earthy color leather, turquoise and neutrals color feathers and beads to infuse your bedroom with a warth,relaxing glow. This large dream catchers for wall give more of a chic look and make it the best way to be part of any room decor whether it’s your living room, your bedroom or a nursery room. 💎【Fantasy LED Light String】Assembled with warm color LED string lights, this dream catcher large is more fabulous that really brighten up your room in stunning colors and bring you a fancy and cozy night. Sting lights are wound up and 2 Cr2032 batteries are included. 💎【Material and Size】These leather suede wrapped dreamcatcher wall decor have 5 hoops, the main hoop on the top and 4 smaller ones hanging to bottom side.All hoops are adorned with turquoise stones.Natural feathers and beads dangle beneath from the hoops making this an elegant dream catcher for girls that will enchant your space while helping to ensure a night full of good dreams. Top Hoop 6.2''/Lower Hoop 2\"/ Overall wide 9* length 26.8 inches (with hanging string) . 💎【100% Handmade Dream Catcher】Purely handcrafted to preserve tradition of the most authentic dream catcher. All our craftsmen have more than 3 years of handmade experience to ensure the stunning results of dream catchers. 💎【Fantastic Room Decor】These neutral native american dream catcher would look perfect for any wall decoration, such as: boho decor for bedroom, nursery decor or hippie decor. It is also ideal to be given as a wedding gift, birthday gift, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas for someone you care so much! 💎【Dream Cathers Spiritual Meaning】Dreamcatchers have a great historic past which is having roots coming from the Ojibwe Native American people. Ojibwe dream catchers were used as a talisman for protecting people from bad dreams and nightmares and let positive dreams come through! More recently, dream catchers have been used as a shared symbol of hope and healing. 💎【100% Satisfaction Warranty】If for any reason you are not 100% happy with the dreamcatcher, please click \"Contact Seller\" to contact us and our customer service team will do everything in our power to make it right with 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oojphniXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eraparole","source_asin":"B09X35JVMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X35JVMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X35JVMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
