window.products.push({"id":281221,"name":"Noza Tec Rabbit Wine Bottle Opener with Foil Cutter Kit , Stainless Steel Cork Bottle Tire Corkscrew Collar Pourer Gift Set (Chrome)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlPnLtSYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"✓ Say goodbye to broken corks!  ✓ The wine opener is easy to use and eliminates the stress of broken corks. ✓ No more finger cuts when removing the foil! ✓ The set comes with an easy to use foil cutter that is super sharp and works quickly and easily to expose the cork. ✓ Our wine opener includes a replacement screw.  Use: 1. The first step in using the opener is to bring the lever firmly down to closed position. 2. Firmly grasp the grip handles with one hand and swing lever to full open position. Put the opener over the bottle until it stops in the exact position. Grip the bottle neck firmly with the grip handles. The black screw comes out of the metal axis. 3. Slowly bring the lever up and return to closed position. The screw has been driven fully into the cork and is ready to pull the cork. 4. Keep a firm grip on the bottle neck with the handles and slowly lift the lever back and over the bottle to the open position. 5. Remove the bottle by loosening your grip on the handles. 6. Take the cork out of the corkscrew.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rlPnLtSYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noza Tec","source_asin":"B06XCGW3CF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XCGW3CF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XCGW3CF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
