window.products.push({"id":281296,"name":"Dr. Prepare Projection Alarm Clock, Digital Clock Projector with Indoor/Outdoor Thermometer Hygrometer, USB Charger and AC & Battery Operated, Dual Al","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PO3Dy8bSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dr. Prepare digital projection clock is compact, lightweight and multifunctional. It a perfect gift choice and an ideal travel companion. ◕ Projection: The optimum projection range is 3. 3 - 10 feet. This projection clock takes turns displaying indoor / outdoor temperature every 5 seconds. ◕ WWVB Signals: At 1: 00 a. m. / 2: 00 a. m. / 3: 00 a. m. the backlight and projection will automatically shut off to receive radio signals for time calibration. After the calibration, the backlight and projection will resume. ◕ Time Zone: Time zone setting: long press MODE button for over 2 seconds. Press MODE button for 4 times until it comes to set time zone. Choose a time zone and press MODE button to confirm the setting. ◕ DST (Daylight Saving Time): DST setting (make sure you have chosen a correct time zone): long press MODE button for over 2 seconds. Then, press MODE button for 5 times until it comes to set time zone. Press \"+\" or \"-\" to turn on / off DST. Press MODE button for another time to confirm the setting. ◕ Battery Backup: Backlight of the screen and projection will shut off when using batteries (not included) as power source. ◕ Wireless Remote Sensor: 433. 92 MHz RF transmitting frequency. 200 feet transmission range in an open area. ◕ Specifications: ▶ Indoor temperature measurement ranges: 14°F ~ 122°F ▶ Outdoor temperature measurement ranges: -40°F ~ 158°F ▶ Temperature alternatively in °F or °C. ▶ Screen display supports dimmer: 3 brightness levels off ▶ Adapter output: 5V/1. 5A - European USB charger plug ▶ Battery backup: 2 x AAA batteries (not included ◕ Notes: Please read the instructions carefully before using it and learn how to change the temperature unit, how to set the time zone, how to set the daylight saving time manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PO3Dy8bSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DR.PREPARE","source_asin":"B07TFGNNCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TFGNNCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TFGNNCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
