window.products.push({"id":281372,"name":"TeraGanix Bokashi Food Waste Recycling System | Affordable Bokashi Starter Kit with 2 Kitchen Compost Bins with Flexible Lid and 5lb Bag of EM-1 TeraK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711DTEVWtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What is Bokashi? Bokashi uses an anerobic fermentation process rather than decomposition to break down food waste. We use EM1 in the fermentation process because it is teaming with live microbes, enzymes, trace minerals, and vitamins that help other beneficial life grow. This method allows you to efficiently compost scraps into nutrient-rich humus for your vegetable crops or flower garden, in far less time than standard compost systems and with no offensive odors. The simple method we have designed is easy to understand and use, even elementary school children use this method in their schools! By adding the Bokashi bran to the compost bucket for kitchen scraps, the organic microbes naturally accelerate the decomposition of your foods waste in half the time of traditional composting. Use TeraGanix Bokashi Food Waste Recycling System with all types of food scraps, even cheese, meat, oil and bones! Our compost accelerator breaks down food waste to release valuable nutrients that are highly beneficial to plants when composted. When chopped into 1” pieces, food will compost quicker than larger pieces. Perfect for your garden! Bury completed compost directly in your garden as an organic fertilizer. Bury at least 4\" deep and let it breakdown for 2 weeks before planting. Also great to use with an indoor compost bin, worm compost bin, outdoor compost bin, compost tumbler, or any other composter of your choice! Complete Bokashi Composting Kit Includes: 2 Bokashi Buckets 2 Flexible Bucket Lids One 5 lb Bag of TeraKashi Bokashi Fertilizer made with certified organic rice bran and EM-X Ceramics for better fermentation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711DTEVWtSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeraGanix","source_asin":"B009DI4UO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281372","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009DI4UO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009DI4UO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":281373,"name":"Bialetti Aeternum Red 7314 Muffin Pan, 12 cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kDV49u7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the perfect layered cake with this Aeternum 9-inch Round Cake pan from Bialetti. The Aeternum bakeware collection features durable, heavy-gauge aluminized steel construction and a red, high-temp non-stick exterior making it the ideal piece to go from kitchen to table. The bakeware's white ceramic interior is designed for easy release and better browning. This earth-friendly pan is PTFE, PFOA, and Cadmium-free, and unlike other nonstick bakeware, Aeternum's nonstick coating will not become absorbed in your food. Large handle design provides better control and a secure grip for ease of use. Made of heavy gauge steel and is oven safe up to 400-degrees F. With Aeternum ceramic coating, always use a little oil or butter when baking foods. For best results, hand wash with non-abrasive cleansers and liquid dishwashing soap. Use only nylon, wood, or high temperature silicone tools. In order to guarantee the best performance, avoid sharp pointed metal utensils that could scratch or ruin the nonstick surface. Do not use knives or small appliances such as electric mixer to chop or mix food if your cookware. Such use can damage the interior surface and void the warranty. Bialetti began in Italy, but has become a leading brand around the world for its high-quality products bringing simplicity, functionality and beauty to the kitchen. Bialetti's advanced technology and distinctive styling combine to create cookware that's simple to use and simply beautiful. Bialetti is authentically Italian, where the kitchen is the heart of the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kDV49u7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B00LHT6N18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LHT6N18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LHT6N18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
