window.products.push({"id":281406,"name":"Bargoose | Zippered Crib Mattress Cover | Vinyl Bed Protector | Waterproof Material | Premium Box Spring Encasement | Guards from Bed Bugs, Liquids & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gk63LimFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Plastic ALL-AROUND PROTECTION: By using protective bedding, you can extend the life of your mattress. Whether you are saving it from bedwetting accidents or protecting your mattress from bedbugs and dust mites, protective covers help preserve your mattress in its original condition. Our waterproof bed covers are zippered styled overlays so you get full protection on the top, bottom and sides. EFFECTIVE BED BUG BARRIER: Unfortunately, bed bugs are very difficult to control. So we take our mattress protection one step further as our products feature a patented tape closure that fits securely over the rust-proof zipper end to form a complete seal that prevents bed bugs and more from getting in or out. HEAVYWEIGHT 6 GAUGE VINYL: By utilizing our zippered mattress and boxspring covers, you can be sure you are protected. As our heavyweight 6 gauge vinyl covers safeguard against spills, stains, and moisture resulting from accidents, fluids, and sweat. Vinyl encasements also allow for easy care, simply wipe clean with a damp cloth. FIRE RETARDANT: Vinyl’s thickness not only provides an effective barrier against bed bugs and dust mites, our protective encasements are fire retardant to give you even more protection as you have a great night’s sleep. Topped off with a brushed silk finish to eliminate noise and allow for a comfortable sleep, along with electronically sealed seams to ensure long term use. THE PERFECT FIT: The zippered style of our mattress overlay gives you that tight, snug feeling that is usually associated with fitted covers along with the full 360 protection of true zippered encasements. Increase the longevity of any mattress in your home, whether in your master bedroom or a guest room. Great for the hospitality and medical industries as well!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Gk63LimFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARGOOSE HOME TEXTILES, INC.","source_asin":"B08KBPPX17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KBPPX17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KBPPX17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
