window.products.push({"id":281431,"name":"OVOS Ultra Fast Cooking Thermometer - Digital Thermometer with Instant Read - Long Foldable Probe - For all Liquid or Solid Foods - Meat thermometer f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1R+4meGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Be sure that your food has reached safe temperatures Do you love cooking and want to be more adventurous? Are you new to cooking and want the security of knowing your food has reached the right temperature?  Would you like to be sure that your meat is safe to eat, every time? Say Goodbye to Burnt and Undercooked Food - Achieve Your Perfect Doneness Every Time The temperatures Tester thermometer from OVOS will help ensure all that as below Features: *No more guessing required for all Solid and Liquid Foods, BBQ, Grill, Broiler, Smoker, Oven, Milk, and Bath Water. *LCD display gives you accurate temperature results in 6 seconds. *Displays both ºF and ºC.Displays both ºF and ºC.Open the back cover then it can be switched next to the battery. *Foldable designed for easy carrying or storage. Can conveniently be put it in your pocket. *Before withdrawing from food, press HOLD button. It will \"hold\" the temperature reading. *Magnetic back of the device makes it easy to be attached on your fridge door. *Designed with a hook to allow you to hang on your kitchen wall. *Battery-saving automatic shut-off after 10 minutes. *Waterproof, heat resistant Probe up to 572ºF. *Wide coverage measurement range 58Fº - 572ºF/50ºC - 300Cº. *Visible reference chart temperature guide for grill on the front. *For use anywhere that accurate temperature control is required. *4.5 inches long probe keeps your hands safe while measuring. *Accurate temperature of up to 0.1°C/°F! *Lightweight and durable. *One year warranty. Look No Further...Announcing the Best Super Fast Accurate Meat/BBQ Thermometer- Never Burn or Undercook your Meat Ever Again The Beastometer BBQ thermometer is so slick it's positively badass. So, what are you waiting for? Click the \"Add to Cart\" button at the top right of this page to ensure you never burn or undercook meat or poultry ever again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S1R+4meGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVOS","source_asin":"B01F8M9PWI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281431","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F8M9PWI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F8M9PWI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
