window.products.push({"id":281769,"name":"Markdang Meat Injector,304-Stainless Meat Injector Syringe Kit with 3 Flavor Food Injector for Injection Brine Marinade of Meat,Turkey,Brisket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BJ539cs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SS 304 Material Meat Injector】Our meat injector is made of highest quality materials 304 food-grade stainless steel. Healthy and safe, no rust, no corrode, no bend or break,Guaranteed to keep your family safe! 【Specially Dseign】The meat injector with three Seasoning needles: an angled needle (for minced garlic, onion, solids), the 9-hole needle (for liquid sauces), and the small-holed needle (for smaller meat cuts). you can easy puncture the meat with this marinade injector without blocking. 【Unexpected Surprise】 You don't need to marinating meat, turkey, brisket etc in advance before starting BBQ grill in order to makes the meat tasty, because you can directly injection marinade into meat’s inner by our food injector. 【What You Get】This marinade injector contains 1pc 2-OZ capacity marinade injector barrel; 3pc professional meat needles; 5pcs spare syringe silicone O-rings; 3pcs cleaning bush; 1pc BBQ brush; 2pc BBQ Bear Claw. 【Perfect Gift】The meat injector syringe kit makes the perfect present for professional and amateur chefs to last to intensify flavors of Thanksgiving/ Christmas turkey, meat- beef brisket, pork butts, lamb, chicken, goose and duck. Perfect for BBQ, smoked grill, family party, bonfire party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BJ539cs2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Markdang","source_asin":"B09NZMR895","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NZMR895","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NZMR895","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":281770,"name":"Touching and Heartfelt Poem for Sisters - Sister, Thank You…Poem on 11 x 14 inches Double Beveled Matting (Burgundy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jo+6BX8zL._AC_.jpg","description":"Beautiful and Inspiring Poem for all gifting occasions. Your sister will be thrilled and full with joy. Shower her with your love, give her a gift from the heart, give her a poem from GoodOldSaying! We have Gifts that: ---Keep on giving and last a lifetime---Are motivational, Inspirational, Spiritual and Thoughtful---Appreciated because she knows you really care---Have potential to change lives---Make her by bringing sunshine and hope. Like a greeting card, a GoodOldSaying poem can express your feelings, but GoodOldSaying can also be framed and displayed. It's a wonderful gift that will be cherished for years to come. ------Caption for entire poem----- Sister, Thank You For All You Are To Me Sister, I just want to say In a short and sweet way . . . That if I had all the woman In the world to choose from To have as my very own sister . . . I would choose the one woman I cherish with all my heart, I would choose her because I know her so well . . . And because I know How much there is to love. And it would be you. Thanks for being everything you are to me!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jo+6BX8zL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poems for Sisters","source_asin":"B07BQMGRFH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQMGRFH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQMGRFH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
