window.products.push({"id":281860,"name":"Cervical Pillow Memory Foam Pillow for Pain Relief, Ergonomic Contour Pillow for Neck & Shoulder Pain, Soft Orthopedic Neck Support Pillow for Side, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+up6N7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Suitable Size & Premium Material- Are you looking for a memory foam pillow to relieve your neck or shoulder pain? EPOGG neck pillow can do it! Size: 61*42*12cm ( 24*16.5*4.7 in); GW: 1.27kg (2.8lb). Our memory foam pillow is made of high density which less space inside than others' memory foam pillow, providing a better support for your neck and relaxing your spine. Wake up feeling refreshed, and any neck pain you may have suffered will fade away over time. Recess Design- The recess design not only allows your arms to bend around the wings for perfect support to help you sleep without numbness, also provides enough space for shoulders and good nasal airflow for back, side and stomach sleepers. EPOGG cervical pillow memory foam pillows are Ergonomically designed to naturally and perfectly fit the curve of the spine, providing comfortable and healthy support for the head, neck, shoulders and spine, allowing you to ease into an uninterrupted sleep. Slow-Rebound Memory Foam - Pure memory foam, non-toxic, non-allergenic, will rebound in 3-5 seconds,which can relieve the pressure evenly and relax muscles fully , prevent neck shoulder back pain, snoring. Removable Cooling Pillowcase - The neck pillow features a double breathable pillow case with zipper so it is removable and easy to clean, hand wash and machine washable. The pillow is made of hypoallergenic polyester, no pilling, soft and skin-friendly, breathable, allowing air to circulate through the pillow all night long, taking care of your skin, keeping you fresh all night long away from night sweat. Guaranteed - EPOGG memory foam pillow will soft in all seasons. Choose our ergonomic pillows to relieve neck pain and other sleep problems, and you will experience your sleep improved in ways you never imagined. This is also a great health care gift to show your loved ones that you care. You can buy with confidence, and if you don't like our pillows 100%, we'll be sure to help solve the problem!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+up6N7QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EPOGG","source_asin":"B09SNXJFSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-281860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SNXJFSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SNXJFSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
